## User

Sort a list with quicksort.

## Type

type
```haskell
quicksort :: Ord a => [a] -> [a]
```

## Term

```haskell
quicksort [] = []
quicksort (x:xs) = quicksort [y | y <- xs, y < x] ++ [x] ++ quicksort [y | y <- xs, y > x]
```

